Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Target K is the desired number of clusters at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}目标 K 表示最终期望得到的簇数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:09.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Capacity is a hard upper limit on the total size inside each cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:09.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量是每个簇内总大小不可超过的上限。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:15.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}With capacity two, two unit-size cells fit together, but a third cell does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:15.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}容量为二时，两个大小为一的单元可以合并，但不能再加入第三个。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:19.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}A small cutsize does not make an oversized cluster legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:19.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}割边权重总和较小，并不能让超容量的簇变得合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:25.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}We must report whether the algorithm actually reaches K while respecting capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:25.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}我们必须报告算法在遵守容量约束的同时，是否真的达到目标 K。
